<title>USA: Horizon Mental Health OK'S stock split.</title>
<headline>Horizon Mental Health OK'S stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LEWISVILLE, Texas 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon Mental Health Management Inc said Wednesday that it will have a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said it will issue one share for every two common shares. The shares will be distributed January 31 to shareholders of record January 22.</p>
<p>&quot;The Board's decision to effect the stock split demonstrates our positive outlook for 1997 and beyond,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>Horizon Mental manages mental health programs in 36 states. It has about 3.7 million common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
